{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:102924","published":"2026-11-25T18:06:42.592292Z","modified":"2026-11-25T18:30:02.253907940Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-132858"],"summary":"Important: gdm security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The GNOME Display Manager (GDM) provides the graphical login screen. The screen is shown shortly after boot, after log out, and when switching the current user.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* gdm: Missing authorization on CreateRemoteDisplay allows autologin as arbitrary users, including root (CVE-2026-132858)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Make smartcard method default when smartcad is inserted in login screen  (gdm) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-287797)\n\n* Unable to switch users with smartcards with virtual terminals disabled (Rocky Linux-10) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-307213)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"gdm-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/gdm-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:47.0-36.el10_3"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:102924.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gdm-devel","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/gdm-devel?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:47.0-36.el10_3"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"CRB"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:102924.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gdm-debugsource","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/gdm-debugsource?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:47.0-36.el10_3"}